        {
          "te": "మీ",
          "gloss": "your (polite)"
        },
        {
          "te": "పేరు",
          "gloss": "name"
        },
        {
          "te": "ఏంటి",
          "gloss": "what"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "introductions",
        "questions"
      ],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "ఏంటి (enti) is how everyone actually says 'what' — the textbook form ఏమిటి (emiti) sounds formal in conversation."
    },
    {
